{
  "conceptual": "\n<p sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">The devlog contains informal articles about the development of EZ. They explain <em sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">why</em> certain features exist and how they came to be.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">Devlog articles describe the state of things at the time they were written. For up-to-date details, always refer to the <a href=\"~/pages/docs/docs-overview.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">documentation</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"articles\" sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\">Articles</h2>\n<ul sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">\n<li sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\"><a href=\"~/pages/devlog/render-pipeline-switches.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">Configurable Render Pipelines</a> (October 2026)</li>\n</ul>\n<p sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\">For the devlog of the Monster Attack sample, see <a href=\"~/pages/samples/monster-attack/devlog-1.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/devlog/devlog-overview.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\">this page</a>.</p>\n",
